@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Overview"; }
<section class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFRASTRUCTURE, IN VIEW</p><h1>Deployment overview</h1><p class="muted">Manage hosts and deliver consistent deployments across your environment.</p></div><div class="sync"><span class="dot"></span><span id="sync-status">Connecting…</span><button id="refresh" class="button subtle">Refresh</button></div></section>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<section class="metrics" aria-label="Workspace summary"><article class="metric"><span>REGISTERED HOSTS</span><strong id="total-hosts">—</strong><small>Your connected infrastructure</small></article><article class="metric"><span>ONLINE NOW</span><strong id="online-hosts">—</strong><small>Heartbeat received recently</small></article><article class="metric"><span>ACTIVE JOBS</span><strong id="active-jobs">—</strong><small>Queued or executing</small></article><article class="metric"><span>SUCCESSFUL JOBS</span><strong id="success-jobs">—</strong><small>Within the latest 200 jobs</small></article></section>
<div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Host registry</h2><p class="muted">Select deployment targets. Resources show each Agent environment.</p></div><span class="tag">AGENTS</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th><span class="sr-only">Select</span></th><th>Host</th><th>Status</th><th>Last seen / Resources</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="hosts"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading your hosts…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<aside class="panel deploy-panel"><p class="eyebrow">NEW DEPLOYMENT</p><h2>Run a playbook</h2><p class="muted">Each selected host receives its own tracked job.</p><form id="deploy-form"><label for="deployment-name">Deployment name</label><input id="deployment-name" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. MinIO — UAT rollout" required /><label for="playbook">Approved playbook</label><select id="playbook" required><option value="">Loading…</option></select><div class="selection-summary"><strong id="selected-count">0 hosts selected</strong><p>Offline hosts retain queued jobs until they reconnect. Each host can have one active job.</p></div><button id="deploy-button" class="button primary full" type="submit">Start deployment →</button></form></aside></div>
<section class="panel history"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Deployment activity</h2><p class="muted">Latest 200 jobs, with results for each target host.</p></div><button id="view-audit" class="button subtle">View audit trail</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Deployment / Host</th><th>Status</th><th>Created</th><th>Result</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="jobs"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading activity…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<dialog id="detail-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="detail-title">Job output</h2><button id="close-dialog" class="button subtle">Close</button></div><p id="detail-note" class="muted"></p><pre id="detail-content"></pre></dialog>
@section Scripts { <script src="~/js/dashboard.js" asp-append-version="true" defer></script> }
